    "summary": "The loop that operates the hiqlite governance corpus: AGENTS.md as the single cross-agent protocol authority, the justfile recipes that are the only sanctioned entry points to spec-spine, the read-only pull-request CI job, and the policy any future session hook must satisfy. Relates to the bootstrap by depends_on and by extends edges on the two units the bootstrap established; it does not re-establish them and does not replace the bootstrap's ownership.\n",
